1  | R(a,b) ∧ (R(b,a) → R(c,c))
2  | a=b
   |----
3  | R(b,b) ∧ (R(b,b) → R(c,c))         = Elim: 1, 2
4  | R(b,b)                             ∧ Elim: 3
5  | R(b,b) → R(c,c)                    ∧ Elim: 3
6  | R(c,c)                             → Elim: 5,4
7  | | ¬R(c,a)
   | |----
8  | | | a=c
   | | |----
9  | | | ¬R(c,c)                        = Elim: 7, 8
10 | | | ⊥                              ⊥ Intro: 6, 9
11 | | ¬(a=c)                           ¬ Intro: 8-10
12 | ¬R(c,a) → ¬(a=c)                   → Intro: 7-11
